<title>JAPAN: Nagoya Railroad files bond shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Nagoya Railroad files bond shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nagoya Railroad Co Ltd said on Friday that it had filed a shelf registration with the Ministry of Finance, effective from November 7, to issue up to 50 billion yen worth of corporate bonds.</p>
</text>
